(7763694, 1286748, 122678, '<td valign="top">This is stunning not only the presentation of a lost art but a beautifully executed image in lighting and coloration which I believe to be a sepia tone of B/W. I am rooting for the blue here.</td>', 'This is stunning not only the presentation of a lost art but a beautifully executed image in lighting and coloration which I believe to be a sepia tone of B/W. I am rooting for the blue here.', '2024-02-14 07:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
