(7763955, 1286787, 138630, '<td valign="top">Charming street, a gentleman who looks enjoyable to visit with, crisp tones and lots of textures.  8</td>', 'Charming street, a gentleman who looks enjoyable to visit with, crisp tones and lots of textures.  8', '2024-02-20 09:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763956, 1286783, 138630, '<td valign="top">I would have enjoyed the textures and tones alone, but the leaf (and imprints of others now gone) is what keep me here and engages my thoughts.  Great title to subtly call attention to it.  8</td>', 'I would have enjoyed the textures and tones alone, but the leaf (and imprints of others now gone) is what keep me here and engages my thoughts.  Great title to subtly call attention to it.  8', '2024-02-20 10:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763957, 1286671, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great patterns.  More than a hint of mystery.  A look of days gone by - why does this bring the 1920''s to mind?  I also like the tones with the very subtle warming of the face.  8</td>', 'Great patterns.  More than a hint of mystery.  A look of days gone by - why does this bring the 1920''s to mind?  I also like the tones with the very subtle warming of the face.  8', '2024-02-20 10:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763959, 1286787, 50695, '<td valign="top">nicely composed image. his foot hovering over a plate(?) in the road is like a very very subtle version of Bresson''s decisive moment photo of someone running over a wet surface. one can imagine it''s the same person, now over a hundred years old, his decisive moment whittled down all these years.</td>', 'nicely composed image. his foot hovering over a plate(?) in the road is like a very very subtle version of Bresson''s decisive moment photo of someone running over a wet surface. one can imagine it''s the same person, now over a hundred years old, his decisive moment whittled down all these years.', '2024-02-20 10:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
