(7764050, 1286733, 117474, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments all <br/> <br/>This image looks rather complex, but it was the real-world scene that evoked the complexity. Obviously this was accentuated by my edit, but what struck me, and what made me select it, was seeing the chaos in the real world. Hard to describe it. <br/> <br/>Honestly, I''m quite happy that this didn''t land so well with all of you. It''s nice to have something just for myself now and then :-)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments all  This image looks rather complex, but it was the real-world scene that evoked the complexity. Obviously this was accentuated by my edit, but what struck me, and what made me select it, was seeing the chaos in the real world. Hard to describe it.  Honestly, I''m quite happy that this didn''t land so well with all of you. It''s nice to have something just for myself now and then :-)', '2024-02-21 13:36:49.000000', NULL, 0),
